  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you damage a creature with an attack or a spell and the creature is larger than you, you can make the attack or spell deal extra damage to it equal to your Proficiency Bonus. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, regaining all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest, and no more than once per turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-LrWXAazuTLYACbhe\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The extra damage has the type of the attack or spell: choose it in the roll dialog.</p></section>",
